From e33165d6c90595e221ec5ea39413f1002040907c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 21:29:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] erofs: harden signed referrer imports

Materialize validated inline descriptor data during retained OCI graph imports, keep custom artifact fetches repository-scoped, and bound re-sign history plus descriptor sizes before persistence.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Copilot-Session: 925784b1-44a7-4d56-b04f-e527d2e0879f
